# Container vulnerability scan exceptions.
#
# Native trivy ignore format, one entry per line:
#
#   CVE-YYYY-#### exp:YYYY-MM-DD
#   GHSA-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx exp:YYYY-MM-DD
#
# Findings reported without a CVE alias (GitHub security advisories) use
# their GHSA id.
#
# The comment block directly above an entry records the remediation owner
# and the justification (see docs/image-scanning.md):
#
#   # patched in the next upstream base image digest
#   # owner:@alice
#   CVE-2025-12345 exp:2026-08-01
#
# Rules: only IDs reported by the scan may be listed, each ID at most once,
# and exp must be a valid date at most 90 days out. An expired exception
# stops being ignored and fails the daily scan again.

